# uv lockfile — this project installs with pip (see CLAUDE.md); uv only
# appears in docs/hardware/jetson-orin-nano.md in `uv pip` compat mode,
# which never writes a lockfile. Anything here is a stray `uv lock`/`uv
# sync` that nothing regenerates, so it would drift from pyproject.toml.
uv.lock
